[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:18.54]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:22.94]left a single note and went on their way
[00:28.66]I never got their name until the credits
[00:33.24]now it plays here every single day
[00:37.58]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:40.62]One note at a time
[00:46.66]from people passing through
[00:50.60]a name beside a line
[00:55.44]and part of it is you
[01:00.52]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
